ry care: Provides inpatient, outpatient and ambulatory care services, including IVF, IUI, blastocyst culture, surgical sperm retrieval, PGT and assisted hatching.","Fertility services: Provides fertility services such as assisted reproductive technology and specialized fertility procedures.","Obstetrics services: Provides pre-pregnancy screening and counselling, family planning counselling, antenatal checkup and delivery services.","Gynecology services: Provides gynecology services including hysterectomy, oophorectomy, colposcopy, hysteroscopy, laparoscopy, tubal ligation, dilation and curettage, and marsupialization.","Pediatrics, diagnostic imaging and other healthcare services: Provides pediatrics services, diagnostic imaging services and other healthcare services."]}}